{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><figure><img src=\"https://cdn3.am730.com.hk/processed/2026-10/1059554/block/singleImage/3244527/df/1487321066.jpg?updatedAt=1792578905\"/><figcaption>內地股市 上證指數止三連升</figcaption></figure><p>上證綜合指數收報 3713 點，跌 22 點，跌幅 0.6% 。 深證成份指數收報 11704 點，跌 96 點，跌幅 0.82% 。 創業板指數收報 2694 點，跌 44 點，跌幅 1.62% 。 滬深 300 指數收報 4111 點，跌 40 點，跌幅 0.97% 。 上證指數最高升至 3743 點，隨後大市下滑，最低跌至 3703 點，全日成交 6427.52 億元。深成指最高升至 11909 點，其後淡友發惡，最低跌至 11666 點，全日成交 7865.93 億元。釀酒股跌近 2% ；汽車製造股跌逾 1% ；傳媒娛樂股升近 2% 。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-21T10:40:24.394865+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":289,"images":1,"source":"am730","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-21T08:33:39+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-21T10:37:48.664596+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-21T10:37:48.664596+00:00","content_hash":"9d39ffe21daa8f7c79263a5d9a52ba4b71d7ec2e3ebb5834f926bd4abd453bed","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}